cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this model, please cite it as below."
title: "Buffalo Bioeconomic Model"
type: software
version: "2.0"
date-released: "2026-08-13"
authors:
  - family-names: Khatkar
    given-names: Mehar Singh
abstract: >
  Bioeconomic decision-support model for dairy buffalo (Murrah) enterprises in
  North-West India. Couples a monthly cohort herd projection with a
  technological requirements model and full financial analysis (Indian
  business taxation, loan structuring, NPV/IRR/BCR/DSCR) driven entirely by an
  editable parameter workbook. Delivered as an R engine, Shiny application and
  Excel report generator.
keywords:
  - bioeconomic model
  - buffalo
  - dairy
  - decision support
  - R
  - Shiny
